{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "fadbda0be407eefa2f2e20ae21111d4420ac8cd62f2050b429086d059b302e5f", "ja": "マイペースなミーティング", "zh": "按自己的步调开会", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dc91340a5d06ac3cd061d03fdbfc7840ffe9c1b889577478bb869e292ad3d86a", "ja": "バラエティ番組企画の学園祭ライブを終えた\n美也、朋花、まつりの3人は、新曲公演に向\nけた準備を本格化。学園祭で縁のできた生徒\n達も招待することになり、3人それぞれが\nマイペースに？意気込むのだった。", "zh": "结束综艺节目企划的校园祭演出后，\n美也、朋花和茉莉这3人，开始全面着手准备新歌公演。决定也邀请在校园祭上结识的学生们前来，于是3人各自以自己的步调？鼓起干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1000_401pro", "source_sha256": "5712158f5d0ab9ee1958dc1095cbb14f8b2a3af3c9fbea1d0994d7830884499e", "ja": "よし、3人とも集まったな。\nそれじゃ、ミーティングを始めるぞ！", "zh": "好，3个人都到齐了。\n那么，开始开会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "5ac5cfe80d606051168b889d1c951000d999a0102d07507c92812895e1353f1b", "ja": "議題はもちろん、今度の公演についてですね～。\n劇場からもしっかり、聖母の愛を広めましょう～。", "zh": "议题当然是关于下次公演的事呢～。\n让我们也从剧场出发，好好传播圣母的爱吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "68bbaa5083f2b5c8a5678547113f3f744000d085e84d614c0d98f6e7e112ec1c", "ja": "はいほー！　今度は姫のお城で、とびきり・きゅーと！\nなステージのお披露目なのです♪", "zh": "嗨哟！这次要在公主的城堡里，公开展示超级可爱的舞台哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "27d4a1294cc5a4769d4873d47d9468e1b8d3e522cdacc908f64fca454875f0cd", "ja": "むーん。せっかくなので、もう一度しっかり仕上げて、\n学園祭の時以上のステージをお見せしたいですな～。", "zh": "嗯……难得有这个机会，我想再认真打磨一遍，给您呈现一场比学园祭时更精彩的舞台呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "e72d442e43771426a2062a899ccf8a9a166def7baa4d89ad0c86da478dedf677", "ja": "というわけで、プロデューサーさん。\nあらためてお願いがありまして～。", "zh": "所以，制作人。\n我还有件事想再拜托您～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "19fe1a6e28a0abd52642fd8c266fb3b280f3c1359e6912d005f5728de578a1ae", "ja": "学園祭でお世話になったはなちゃん達、\n生徒のみなさんをご招待できませんか～？", "zh": "在校庆受到小花她们照顾的、\n那些学生们，能不能邀请他们来呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "3b72f79624548c963e6d9b05783e72e756301cb0910addeaee467c45623a4a7f", "ja": "もちろんそのつもりだよ。まぁ全校生徒は無理だけど、\nお世話になった実行委員の子達ぐらいはね。", "zh": "我当然是这么打算的。虽然全校学生是不太可能啦，\n但至少照顾过我们的执行委员的孩子们还是可以的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "616a6522dd696cc8fa72a1a3e7c8b41f1da96614b16083958dc102ea6c954f9c", "ja": "じつは一般告知と同時に招待状を送ったんだ。そしたら\n委員長さんからすぐ返信が来てさ！　えーっと……。", "zh": "其实我在公开通知的同时也寄出了邀请函。结果委员会长很快就回信了！呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "068e9101c494ac8dd51a1df6c8d96d9245f69c74b426e9cf90a93b5756a67dd1", "ja": "『今度は劇場で見られるなんて夢みたい！　美也ちゃん\n達3人の息ぴったりのステージ、今から楽しみです！』", "zh": "“这次能在剧场看到你们，简直像做梦一样！美也和其他3人的默契舞台，我从现在起就开始期待了！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "7fe03c286c3eb6f0ca69e0b2a48a7d38c64a095b1855a5dde80f92e8b9b1b602", "ja": "……だそうだ。あははっ、そうだよな。学園祭ライブを\n終えて、3人の絆もますます深まったというか……。", "zh": "……信上是这么写的。哈哈，也是啊。结束了学园祭演出后，感觉你们3个人的羁绊也变得越来越深了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "6b05a50d9a499a2e965a0d620387a4ae06ea408e5739936b6168a783204e97d2", "ja": "そうでもありませんよ～？／ないのですよ？", "zh": "也没那么夸张哦～？／也不是那样哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "5cae8bc462322a3dc579af8d9ec78b80832118203bf50c71711700bddb7ea002", "ja": "そうでもないのですよ？", "zh": "也不是这样的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "3d1ae39cee00eb61286293011686bd55ea3d85e468b05e57803245a57b8e9c83", "ja": "私たちは3人ともマイペースなので……\n息はむしろ、バラバラかもしれませんね～♪", "zh": "我们3个人都各有各的节奏，所以……\n步调反而可能是乱的呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "7a972174ca8786daeffb46428244145b53c3c7a4f3175ed50a9540252d5e0647", "ja": "えっ。……ええっ！？", "zh": "咦……什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "ab807d32f674414165ff65024e75f76952786ed3b2dcb6da2bbabfaebe367363", "ja": "公演もマイペースにいくのです♪　姫の姫による\n姫のための劇場公演！　とっても楽しみなのです♪", "zh": "演出也要按自己的节奏来哦♪　公主的、由公主举办的、\n为了公主的剧场公演！真是令人期待呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "fb4bc6cbb1ed3f9cb6e3c2bf80dd6632f27eee0b37472b7a5fe36331d6fae658", "ja": "息はバラバラでも大丈夫ですよ～。聖母の慈愛の光で\n客席を隅々まで照らすことを約束してあげましょう～。", "zh": "就算呼吸节奏各不相同也没关系哦～我答应你们，会用圣母慈爱的光芒照亮观众席的每一个角落哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "6eabbe4057c3eddbf632e67b582b7d61e514c82365e7569e6c96acf8a2bbdc68", "ja": "朋花ちゃん、間違えているのです。今度の公演は、\n姫のためのふわふわ・きゅーと！なライブなのですよ？", "zh": "朋花，你搞错了哦。这次的公演，\n是专为公主打造的蓬松可爱风演唱会呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "3b893024fc6b0b65ba6eb6e9d912afb69b1ca5f51e42ed116709c33ab029188b", "ja": "まつりさんこそ間違えていますね～。今度の公演は、\n聖母の慈愛をあまねく届かせるための祭壇ですよ～。", "zh": "茉莉小姐才是弄错了呢～？下次的演出，\n可是为了将圣母的慈爱普惠众生的祭坛哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "d49b8dd179b5f784a59148fd5ce007b86ffb8461fe08bf7c43987a039a648f94", "ja": "ほ？　そんなことは初耳なのです。", "zh": "哦？我还是第一次听说这种事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "261dbdc480d91077da6ea70f0a8a8f911d5d54c98151f51438d2522388b9e60c", "ja": "その言葉、そっくりそのままお返しします～。", "zh": "那句话原封不动地还给你～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "832d2b7d42ee21e15508658311d8c9e504c7833a1b1c1df5490f8298bea2e32f", "ja": "ほ？　ほ？", "zh": "咦？咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "11eb1ee3d124fc4f19242c7374b3666ee43770eeeee1289975f5418e58a833f0", "ja": "うふふ、うふふふふふ～♪", "zh": "呵呵呵，呵呵呵呵呵～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "e064539f18e61330784614cba7e6f7a8ec0df03b29cf713c3f0c8fe05b664c38", "ja": "お～。お二人ともやる気十分ですな～。\n今から本番が楽しみです～♪", "zh": "哦～。两位都干劲十足呢～  \n真期待接下来的正式演出～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "b2a40d2703b6aa8468ee5930e959e5dcca0b9dcbc4371f38a9c49aa05387a3b7", "ja": "そ、そうかな……？\n今からものすごく不安なんだけど……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？\n我现在可是非常不安啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "db7bc6dc1e63243a0b139dcd2e8fd48a0954ba7d3e1913a696aea3624ffd9b7e", "ja": "あっ、そうか。これはいわゆるアレか！\nケンカするほど仲がいいっていう……", "zh": "啊，这么说来，是那个对吧！  \n就是所谓的“越吵架关系越好”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "8b8b9bea1a0fba213b701b417d2c0ff5c005cce0254b62b5498766ff09f821f9", "ja": "違います～♪／違うのです♪", "zh": "不是～♪／不是这样的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "beef199878fd1e8d07f440ef1403148949948482b616aaa21172b750d06885cb", "ja": "違うのです♪", "zh": "不对哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1028_401pro", "source_sha256": "6f367de384f04be0092b3550ebd7f4fd93db3ab803a55ac5bea941442bab9bb3", "ja": "そ、そっか！　ごめん……なさい……。", "zh": "这、这样啊！对不起……了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "aa50b179b837b00b5eea05d085c4f07ec59af74b7a9d430d6afb4709d447361a", "ja": "とにかく、やる気があるのは間違いないん……だよな？\nよし、それじゃ、本番に向けて頑張っていこう！", "zh": "总之，你确实是有干劲的……对吧？\n好，那就为了正式演出加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_01_1030_401pro", "source_sha256": "be9a3deccf5873506abd6eed553fabdb19c6cbcf6893bbde44b6b3fbc1c66788", "ja": "（いろいろやりたいことがありそうだ。とりあえず、\nヒアリングしてみるか。……念のため、ひとりずつ）", "zh": "（好像有不少想做的事。总之先问问吧……以防万一，还是一个个来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
